{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026rAxZFRALbM1794328171.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>勞工及福利局局長孫玉菡指，截至上月底，勞工處共巡查7,300個地盤，向違規吸煙人士發出84張定額罰款通知書。</p><p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SAFETY-2230.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026dcxTgZ9DiH1794328181.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><br/></p><p>孫玉菡出席活動致辭時指，地盤禁煙實施逾3個月，發出的84張定額罰款通知書，當中28張是建基於市民投訴，大部分為勞工處突擊檢查。處方亦向地盤承建商發出共5張告票，涉及4宗個案。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T16:44:13.265154+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T14:51:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T10:29:50.487677+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T16:37:25.199158+00:00","content_hash":"4151ad3f9364e8bd2a1c619e9365dc27ef05ca7dd6f9780f597ab0a31962e143","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T16:44:13.265154+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}